            "heading": "Who is She Hits for?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>She Hits is for women at every stage of their fitness journey. Whether you’re a complete beginner looking for a supportive start, or someone ready to learn real boxing technique beyond cardio punching, this program is built for you. It’s for women who want confidence, skill, strength, and a strong community.</p>",
