        "collapsible_row_cErQga": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What can I expect in a She Hits session?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Each session focuses on real boxing fundamentals including stance, footwork, punches, defense, and combinations. You’ll also learn practical self-defense foundations like awareness, distance control, and generating power safely. Expect structured coaching, conditioning work, and a motivating women-only environment.</p>",
            "page": ""
