          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do I need boxing experience to join?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>No experience is needed. She Hits is designed to welcome beginners while still challenging those with experience. We teach proper technique from the ground up and progress week by week so you feel confident and capable.</p>",
