          "settings": {
            "heading": "What should I bring to She Hits?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Wear comfortable athletic clothing and training shoes. Bring a water bottle and a towel. Boxing gloves can be provided if needed. Most importantly, come ready to learn, train hard, and support the women around you.</p>",
